 "buildLessons": [
  "createAutoLayout frames default to white fill: always set fills=[]",
  "focus ring: clipsContent=true and effects order [outer focus spread4, inner canvas spread2]",
  "setFileThumbnailNodeAsync unsupported",
  "shared TEXT/INSTANCE_SWAP props reset per-variant content to one default; keep state-specific text out of props",
  "swapped icons lose stroke overrides; recolor after swap",
  "resize() after AUTO sizing resets to FIXED: set AUTO after resize",
  "strokesIncludedInLayout=false keeps stroked and unstroked variants the same height",
  "after editing a main component, rebuild review instances; stale nested overrides can render",
  "Shadow spread (focus ring) renders only with clipsContent=true",
  "Instance swaps (icons in Button, Chip, Badge) drop stroke overrides: recolor the icon to the label color after every swap",
  "Long screens are hug-height 390 frames; sheets (02b, 04) are fixed frames with a scrim and the sheet on top, shown expanded",
  "Label and note frames: resize first, then set primaryAxisSizingMode AUTO and clipsContent false, or the text is cut off",
  "A failed use_figma script rolls back everything it did, including page renames: re-find pages by ID, not by name, on retry",
  "Bind spacing only to tokens that exist (space/1 to 16); an unknown key silently unbinds the gap"
 ],
